abstract: "Lean theorem-facing re-verification of the internal v83 major-revision manuscript Distributional Learning of Context-Free Languages under Fixed Finite-Monoid Typing. This release includes the completed level-coded Appendix substitutability proof and finite indexed R_n/R_n^- exact-language, reducedness, ordinary-thickness, linear-size, and exponential characteristic-sample lower-bound packages."
